{"id":"5024","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5024_main_lightning-cloud-discharge_electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>水平范围很大的云到云的闪电放电</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国Chateau Cl, Gothers, St Dennis, Saint Austell","latitude":"纬度: 50° 23' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 4° 51' 36'' W","date":"17 July 2014 2100 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5081_main_lightning-cloud-discharges_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张照片显示的是在美国内布拉斯加州的一场傍晚雷暴期间，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处闪电的云放电。雷暴的高度相当高，远处可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>，在其中可以看到一部分风暴的大面积砧状云。在右下方可以看到一个小型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>顶部，积云状云转变成为了暴风雨。 在风暴之下，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>明显，远处还有其他积云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州哈姆雷特","latitude":"纬度: 40° 21' 7'' N","longitude":"经度: 101° 7' 25'' W","date":"23 May 2010 2000 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5074_main_anvil-crawler-lightning_electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这张照片显示的是美国内布拉斯加州林肯市一道强烈的中级雷暴砧状云的闪电分支。 这些云放电通俗地称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">“砧状履带”</span>。</p>\n<p>在图像的右侧可以看到无雨<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">上升气流</span>底部。在其他地方，云层细节被强降水掩盖。在无雨上升气流底部附近，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水井</span>明显。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国内布拉斯加州林肯","latitude":"纬度: 40° 48' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 96° 38' 4'' W","date":"01 June 2009 0015 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1.1.2.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4997_main_thunderstorm_clouds-electrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>南中国海北部的热带低气压加剧为名为“银河”的热带风暴。香港（中国）这一天的天气炎热，阳光充足，还有几阵狂风骤雨和雷暴。</p>\n<p>雷暴与积雨云有关，并且通常伴有降水。这张照片显示了晚上从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云</span>中产生的雷暴。雷暴被定义为一次或多次突然放电，表现为闪光<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">（闪电）</span>和刺耳的声音或隆隆声（雷声）。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Sung Lok Cheung","location":"中国香港元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 28' 33'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"26 July 2016 1934 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 3, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.14.1"}]}]}